DESCRIPTION:A Viking has one dream: kill 99 priests so Odin will finally le
 t him go on holiday to London\, eat ice cream and visit London Bridge... wh
 ich\, of course\, the Vikings conquered. Unfortunately\, he also has to rai
 se his baby son according to ancient Viking traditions: survive wolves\, em
 brace violence and one day cut off his father's head. Blending absurd comed
 y\, physical theatre\, audience interaction and unexpected tenderness\, thi
 s brand-new clown adventure explores fatherhood\, inherited traditions and 
 the courage to choose your own path. From the creator of the five-star revi
 ewed Valhalla Calling.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
 nt/sigmund-the-viking-viking-son/
